> > >
> > >  TX -------- RX
> > >  RX -------- TX
> > > CTS -------- RTS
> > > RTS -------- CTS
> > > GND -------- GND (signal ground, not chassis ground)
> > > DCD -------- DTR
> > > DTR -------- DCD
> > > GND -------- (chassis ground on one end to all other wires)
