Hi Riccardo,

RELENG_4 is the development branch of FreeBSD 4.x, aka FreeBSD-STABLE.
Currently they are really close to releasing 4.5, therefore when you updated
to the STABLE version of FreeBSD 4.x, you got 4.5-PRERELEASE.  This is
normal.  I did the same thing today.  If you want to get just 4.4, use
RELENG_4_4.

Take a look at this URL.  It explains the CVS tags...

http://www.freebsd.org/doc/en_US.ISO8859-1/books/handbook/cvs-tags.html

Rob

